<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1304757715"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1445725601"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Save Yourself"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="The Chainsmokers / NGHTMRE"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Sick Boy...Save Yourself"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:30.453"><div begin="00:11.973" end="02:30.683"><p begin="00:11.973" end="00:15.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I should've known what I started<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我本该清楚自己的初心</span></p><p begin="00:15.627" end="00:18.084" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">You should know where your heart is<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你本应明白自己心之所向</span></p><p begin="00:18.130" end="00:21.038" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">But I don't, I won't be a part of<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我绝不会乖乖听命</span></p><p begin="00:22.058" end="00:25.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Expectations when I grow up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">按照他人心意的长大</span></p><p begin="00:26.066" end="00:27.802" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">So, call it what you call it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随便你怎样说吧</span></p><p begin="00:28.902" end="00:32.091" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">But I just won't be afraid of myself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝不会怯于面对真实自我</span></p><p begin="00:32.091" end="00:34.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">'Cause I know that I got it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我清楚我的内心</span></p><p begin="00:35.311" end="00:38.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">I won't give it up just to save myself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会为了自我救赎就选择妥协</span></p><p begin="00:50.996" end="00:52.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">One, two, three<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一 二 三</span></p><p begin="01:17.271" end="01:18.373" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">One, two, three<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一 二 三 躁起来</span></p><p begin="01:51.375" end="01:53.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">I hit it till it's hollow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">瞄准目标我不懈突破直至最后</span></p><p begin="01:54.436" end="01:56.547" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">It's your pride you should swallow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你自命不凡的骄傲 快收起来吧</span></p><p begin="01:56.926" end="01:59.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">But I won't, I'm not one to follow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我不会随波逐流</span></p><p begin="02:01.482" end="02:04.251" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">I won't explain all the things I love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不会为我心中所爱辩解什么</span></p><p begin="02:04.251" end="02:06.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">So, call it what you call it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随便你怎样说吧</span></p><p begin="02:07.834" end="02:10.822" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">I'll be the first one to blame myself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会第一个审视检讨自我</span></p><p begin="02:10.822" end="02:13.058" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">'Cause I know I get caught up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我清楚目前我深陷的困境</span></p><p begin="02:14.059" end="02:17.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">I won't give it up just to save myself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会为了自我救赎就选择妥协</span></p><p begin="02:29.482" end="02:30.683" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">One, two, three<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一 二 三 躁起来</span></p></div></body></tt>